<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 25.79 mln rand SAfrica bonds Thurs.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 25.79 mln rand SAfrica bonds Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 25.79 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Thursday after buying 139.93 million rand's worth on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
